{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 1\n/bin/bash: /etc/bash.bashrc: Permission denied\n/ux/run/tmp/tmp.CBRg6ubr6p\nmetais: \"1.0\"\nname: \"invoice\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\ntitle: \"Invoice\"\ndescription: \"Renders one HTML invoice, with a line for each item and their total, from a JSON object a program supplies.\"\nlicense: \"Apache-2.0\"\nguide: |-\n  This package renders invoice.html, an HTML page that prints one invoice:\n  its number and the date it was issued, the seller and the buyer, a table\n  of the items invoiced with each line's amount, the total, and optional\n  notes. The page carries class names and no style of its own.\n\n  It is written for a program, not a person. A billing job reads the\n  invoice from wherever it is kept, writes it as invoice.json in a data\n  directory, and runs two commands:\n\n      metais validate invoice --data data\n      metais render invoice --data data --out out\n\n  validate reports every value that does not fit the\n  [invoice schema](inputs/invoice.schema.json), and render writes\n  out/invoice.html. Every value is HTML-escaped, so a name, an address, a\n  description or a note may hold any text.\n\n  Each line's amount is its quantity times its unit price, and the total is\n  the sum of the amounts; the program supplies neither. Every amount is in\n  the invoice's one currency, given as its three-letter ISO 4217 code.\n  Leave notes out when there is nothing to add.\ninputs:\n  - name: invoice\n    title: \"Invoice\"\n    description: \"One invoice, as the billing program that issues it holds it.\"\n    schema: inputs/invoice.schema.json\n    forms:\n      - json\noutputs:\n  - id: invoice\n    template: invoice.html.liquid\n    escape: html\n----\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"title\": \"Invoice\",\n  \"description\": \"One invoice: its number, when it was issued, who issued it and to whom, the currency of its amounts, the items it invoices, and optionally notes.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"number\", \"issued\", \"seller\", \"buyer\", \"currency\", \"lines\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"number\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 1,\n      \"maxLength\": 40,\n      \"title\": \"Invoice number\",\n      \"description\": \"The number the seller gave the invoice, as the heading prints it.\",\n      \"examples\": [\"INV-2026-0042\"]\n    },\n    \"issued\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"date\",\n      \"title\": \"Issued\",\n      \"description\": \"The date the invoice was issued, as an RFC 3339 full-date. The invoice prints it as given.\",\n      \"examples\": [\"2026-10-21\"]\n    },\n    \"seller\": {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/party\",\n      \"title\": \"Seller\",\n      \"description\": \"Who issues the invoice and is to be paid.\"\n    },\n    \"buyer\": {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/party\",\n      \"title\": \"Buyer\",\n      \"description\": \"Who the invoice is issued to and is to pay.\"\n    },\n    \"currency\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"pattern\": \"^[A-Z]{3}$\",\n      \"title\": \"Currency\",\n      \"description\": \"The currency of every amount on the invoice, as its three-letter ISO 4217 code.\",\n      \"examples\": [\"EUR\"]\n    },\n    \"lines\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"maxItems\": 100,\n      \"title\": \"Lines\",\n      \"description\": \"The items invoiced, in the order the table lists them.\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"required\": [\"description\", \"quantity\", \"unit_price\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"description\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"maxLength\": 200,\n            \"title\": \"Description\",\n            \"description\": \"What the line invoices, as the table prints it.\",\n            \"examples\": [\"Consulting, October\"]\n          },\n          \"quantity\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\",\n            \"exclusiveMinimum\": 0,\n            \"title\": \"Quantity\",\n            \"description\": \"How many units the line invoices: hours, days or items. It may be fractional.\",\n            \"examples\": [12]\n          },\n          \"unit_price\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\",\n            \"minimum\": 0,\n            \"title\": \"Unit price\",\n            \"description\": \"The price of one unit, in the invoice's currency.\",\n            \"examples\": [95]\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"notes\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 1,\n      \"maxLength\": 1000,\n      \"title\": \"Notes\",\n      \"description\": \"Anything the buyer should read beside the amounts, such as how to pay. Left out, the invoice prints no notes.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"$defs\": {\n    \"party\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\"name\", \"address\"],\n      \"title\": \"Party\",\n      \"description\": \"A person or organization named on the invoice.\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"name\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"maxLength\": 120,\n          \"title\": \"Name\",\n          \"description\": \"The party's name, as the invoice prints it.\",\n          \"examples\": [\"Example Consulting B.V.\"]\n        },\n        \"address\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"maxLength\": 300,\n          \"title\": \"Address\",\n          \"description\": \"The party's postal address, on one line, as the invoice prints it.\",\n          \"examples\": [\"Keizersgracht 1, 1015 CC Amsterdam, Netherlands\"]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n----\n{%- assign inv = inputs.invoice -%}\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>Invoice {{ inv.number }}</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article class=\"invoice\">\n  <h1>Invoice {{ inv.number }}</h1>\n  <p class=\"invoice-issued\">Issued <time datetime=\"{{ inv.issued }}\">{{ inv.issued }}</time></p>\n  <section class=\"invoice-seller\">\n    <h2>From</h2>\n    <p>{{ inv.seller.name }}<br>{{ inv.seller.address }}</p>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"invoice-buyer\">\n    <h2>To</h2>\n    <p>{{ inv.buyer.name }}<br>{{ inv.buyer.address }}</p>\n  </section>\n  <table class=\"invoice-lines\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr><th>Description</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Unit price</th><th>Amount</th></tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n{%- assign total = 0 %}\n{%- for line in inv.lines %}\n{%- assign amount = line.quantity | times: line.unit_price %}\n{%- assign total = total | plus: amount %}\n      <tr><td>{{ line.description }}</td><td>{{ line.quantity }}</td><td>{{ line.unit_price }} {{ inv.currency }}</td><td>{{ amount }} {{ inv.currency }}</td></tr>\n{%- endfor %}\n    </tbody>\n    <tfoot>\n      <tr><th colspan=\"3\">Total</th><td>{{ total }} {{ inv.currency }}</td></tr>\n    </tfoot>\n  </table>\n{%- if inv.notes %}\n  <p class=\"invoice-notes\">{{ inv.notes }}</p>\n{%- endif %}\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\n----\ncat: examples/basic/inputs/invoice.jsonl: No such file or directory","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_012dUpHACYKQbJYfmsU5qPPE"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7159924f-09cd-4cbf-a94b-ddf0494030c4","uuid":"1e541246-3c28-4fc1-9f13-3639baee2b9d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:28:41.081Z","tool_use_result":"Error: Exit code 1\n/bin/bash: /etc/bash.bashrc: Permission denied\n/ux/run/tmp/tmp.CBRg6ubr6p\nmetais: \"1.0\"\nname: \"invoice\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\ntitle: \"Invoice\"\ndescription: \"Renders one HTML invoice, with a line for each item and their total, from a JSON object a program supplies.\"\nlicense: \"Apache-2.0\"\nguide: |-\n  This package renders invoice.html, an HTML page that prints one invoice:\n  its number and the date it was issued, the seller and the buyer, a table\n  of the items invoiced with each line's amount, the total, and optional\n  notes. The page carries class names and no style of its own.\n\n  It is written for a program, not a person. A billing job reads the\n  invoice from wherever it is kept, writes it as invoice.json in a data\n  directory, and runs two commands:\n\n      metais validate invoice --data data\n      metais render invoice --data data --out out\n\n  validate reports every value that does not fit the\n  [invoice schema](inputs/invoice.schema.json), and render writes\n  out/invoice.html. Every value is HTML-escaped, so a name, an address, a\n  description or a note may hold any text.\n\n  Each line's amount is its quantity times its unit price, and the total is\n  the sum of the amounts; the program supplies neither. Every amount is in\n  the invoice's one currency, given as its three-letter ISO 4217 code.\n  Leave notes out when there is nothing to add.\ninputs:\n  - name: invoice\n    title: \"Invoice\"\n    description: \"One invoice, as the billing program that issues it holds it.\"\n    schema: inputs/invoice.schema.json\n    forms:\n      - json\noutputs:\n  - id: invoice\n    template: invoice.html.liquid\n    escape: html\n----\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"title\": \"Invoice\",\n  \"description\": \"One invoice: its number, when it was issued, who issued it and to whom, the currency of its amounts, the items it invoices, and optionally notes.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"number\", \"issued\", \"seller\", \"buyer\", \"currency\", \"lines\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"number\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 1,\n      \"maxLength\": 40,\n      \"title\": \"Invoice number\",\n      \"description\": \"The number the seller gave the invoice, as the heading prints it.\",\n      \"examples\": [\"INV-2026-0042\"]\n    },\n    \"issued\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"date\",\n      \"title\": \"Issued\",\n      \"description\": \"The date the invoice was issued, as an RFC 3339 full-date. The invoice prints it as given.\",\n      \"examples\": [\"2026-10-21\"]\n    },\n    \"seller\": {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/party\",\n      \"title\": \"Seller\",\n      \"description\": \"Who issues the invoice and is to be paid.\"\n    },\n    \"buyer\": {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/party\",\n      \"title\": \"Buyer\",\n      \"description\": \"Who the invoice is issued to and is to pay.\"\n    },\n    \"currency\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"pattern\": \"^[A-Z]{3}$\",\n      \"title\": \"Currency\",\n      \"description\": \"The currency of every amount on the invoice, as its three-letter ISO 4217 code.\",\n      \"examples\": [\"EUR\"]\n    },\n    \"lines\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"maxItems\": 100,\n      \"title\": \"Lines\",\n      \"description\": \"The items invoiced, in the order the table lists them.\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"required\": [\"description\", \"quantity\", \"unit_price\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"description\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"maxLength\": 200,\n            \"title\": \"Description\",\n            \"description\": \"What the line invoices, as the table prints it.\",\n            \"examples\": [\"Consulting, October\"]\n          },\n          \"quantity\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\",\n            \"exclusiveMinimum\": 0,\n            \"title\": \"Quantity\",\n            \"description\": \"How many units the line invoices: hours, days or items. It may be fractional.\",\n            \"examples\": [12]\n          },\n          \"unit_price\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\",\n            \"minimum\": 0,\n            \"title\": \"Unit price\",\n            \"description\": \"The price of one unit, in the invoice's currency.\",\n            \"examples\": [95]\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"notes\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 1,\n      \"maxLength\": 1000,\n      \"title\": \"Notes\",\n      \"description\": \"Anything the buyer should read beside the amounts, such as how to pay. Left out, the invoice prints no notes.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"$defs\": {\n    \"party\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\"name\", \"address\"],\n      \"title\": \"Party\",\n      \"description\": \"A person or organization named on the invoice.\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"name\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"maxLength\": 120,\n          \"title\": \"Name\",\n          \"description\": \"The party's name, as the invoice prints it.\",\n          \"examples\": [\"Example Consulting B.V.\"]\n        },\n        \"address\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"maxLength\": 300,\n          \"title\": \"Address\",\n          \"description\": \"The party's postal address, on one line, as the invoice prints it.\",\n          \"examples\": [\"Keizersgracht 1, 1015 CC Amsterdam, Netherlands\"]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n----\n{%- assign inv = inputs.invoice -%}\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>Invoice {{ inv.number }}</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article class=\"invoice\">\n  <h1>Invoice {{ inv.number }}</h1>\n  <p class=\"invoice-issued\">Issued <time datetime=\"{{ inv.issued }}\">{{ inv.issued }}</time></p>\n  <section class=\"invoice-seller\">\n    <h2>From</h2>\n    <p>{{ inv.seller.name }}<br>{{ inv.seller.address }}</p>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"invoice-buyer\">\n    <h2>To</h2>\n    <p>{{ inv.buyer.name }}<br>{{ inv.buyer.address }}</p>\n  </section>\n  <table class=\"invoice-lines\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr><th>Description</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Unit price</th><th>Amount</th></tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n{%- assign total = 0 %}\n{%- for line in inv.lines %}\n{%- assign amount = line.quantity | times: line.unit_price %}\n{%- assign total = total | plus: amount %}\n      <tr><td>{{ line.description }}</td><td>{{ line.quantity }}</td><td>{{ line.unit_price }} {{ inv.currency }}</td><td>{{ amount }} {{ inv.currency }}</td></tr>\n{%- endfor %}\n    </tbody>\n    <tfoot>\n      <tr><th colspan=\"3\">Total</th><td>{{ total }} {{ inv.currency }}</td></tr>\n    </tfoot>\n  </table>\n{%- if inv.notes %}\n  <p class=\"invoice-notes\">{{ inv.notes }}</p>\n{%- endif %}\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\n----\ncat: examples/basic/inputs/invoice.jsonl: No such file or directory","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012dUpHACYKQbJYfmsU5qPPE","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
