ice --data data --out out\n\nvalidate reports every value that does not fit the\n[invoice schema](inputs/invoice.schema.json), and render writes\nout/invoice.html. Every value is HTML-escaped, so a name, an address, a\ndescription or a note may hold any text.\n\nEach line's amount is its quantity times its unit price, and the total is\nthe sum of the amounts; the program supplies neither. Every amount is in\nthe invoice's one currency, given as its three-letter ISO 4217 code.\nLeave notes out when there is nothing to add.\n\nInputs\n  invoice — Invoice (required; invoice.json)\n    One invoice, as the billing program that issues it holds it.\n\nOutputs\n  invoice.html ← template invoice.html.liquid\n\nReferences\n  1 entry, 771 B\n  references/sources.md (771 B) — Sources and their terms\n\nExamples\n  basic: invoice (with expected outputs)\n  escaping: invoice (with expected outputs)\n\nNext:\n  metais schema <package> invoice  — Prints the schema the input invoice is validated against.\n  metais ls <package> examples/basic/ -r  — Lists the first example's inputs and expected outputs.\n  metais grep <package> <pattern> references/  — Searches the package's references.\n  metais validate <package> --data <dir>  — Validates the inputs you gathered in a data directory.\n  metais render <package> --data <dir> --out <dir>  — Renders the outputs from the validated inputs into a new directory.\nShell cwd was reset to /ux/run/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7159924f-09cd-4cbf-a94b-ddf0494030c4","uuid":"4cec3bfb-9fef-4928-ab2f-ad740f2dae41","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:28:46.513Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"/bin/bash: /etc/bash.bashrc: Permission denied\n/bin/bash: line 1: cd: null directory\n.:\nREADME.md\nexamples\ninputs\nmetais.yaml\nreferences\ntemplates\n\n./examples:\nbasic\nescaping\n\n./examples/basic:\nexample.yaml\nexpected\ninputs\n\n./examples/basic/expected:\ninvoice.html\n\n./examples/basic/inputs:\ninvoice.json\n\n./examples